{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:58 2026-09-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:58 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:58 2026-09-23 HKT</p><p>今日（23日）下午2時52分，一輛貨車沿三號幹線青葵公路往九龍方向行駛，當駛至近亞洲貨櫃物流中心對開時，與一輛電單車相撞。電單車男司機人仰車翻倒地受傷，惟警方接報到場後發現涉事貨車不顧而去，正追查其下落。</p><p>意外發生後，有途經的熱心司機施以援手，將私家車停泊在涉事電單車後方，以防其他車輛撞上。電單車司機四肢擦傷，幸他仍然清醒，其後由救護車送院治理。</p><img alt=\"電單車與貨車相撞，貨車司機不顧而去。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/efde214922ded441c603b6cd2c976cec/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地上血迹斑斑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6aecd82429136f20973cd053418de0b1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_32.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ac17fca3c119ba3a50c2a9e7cec31d50/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2fc31f9110894e46888b7a41e59ce403/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_31_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"鐵騎士由救護車送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3049c14e0722f680892ca12f6b13dea4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_22.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b269f22073d9d3b1a481de900c46db54/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"鐵騎士由救護車送院，他送院時清醒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/fdc207e73bc34643a344872ef162946c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_15_33_17.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T08:21:18.082665+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}